      "created_at": "2019-04-01T18:35:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Parse found Tachyon deep in thought, reading a message:</p>\n<p>“I, Baron Blade, am about prepared to reveal a new, ingenious, all-powerful form. &nbsp;Ha ha ha! &nbsp;Observe the Overblade Elite Neo Cuts 9!”</p>\n<p>Tachyon: &nbsp;I think there’s a secret message, but I can’t find it.</p>\n<p>Parse: &nbsp;Maybe it would be easier if we rearranged it?</p>\n<pre>[code]IBARONBLAD\nEAMABOUTPR\nEPAREDTORE\nVEALANEWIN\nGENIOUSALL\nPOWERFULFO\nRMHAHAHAOB\nSERVETHEOV\nERBLADEELI\nTENEOCUTS9[/code]</pre>\n<p>Tachyon: &nbsp;How is that easier?</p>\n<p>Parse: &nbsp;You don’t see it? &nbsp;Maybe you’re overthinking it.&nbsp; It’s all about the number nine.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:38.381Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 3,
