      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Parse found Tachyon deep in thought, reading a message:\n\n\"I, Baron Blade, am about prepared to reveal a new, ingenious, all-powerful form. &nbsp;Ha ha ha! &nbsp;Observe the Overblade Elite Neo Cuts 9!\"\n\nTachyon: &nbsp;I think there's a secret message, but I can't find it.\n\nParse: &nbsp;Maybe it would be easier if we rearranged it?\n\n<pre>\n[code]IBARONBLAD\nEAMABOUTPR\nEPAREDTORE\nVEALANEWIN\nGENIOUSALL\nPOWERFULFO\nRMHAHAHAOB\nSERVETHEOV\nERBLADEELI\nTENEOCUTS9[/code]</pre>\n\nTachyon: &nbsp;How is that easier?\n\nParse: &nbsp;You don't see it? &nbsp;Maybe you're overthinking it.&nbsp; It's all about the number nine.\n",
