      "created_at": "2019-04-01T19:47:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dpt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/48/1922_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dpt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That’s some deep preparation, unless the pre-dated the “Joined” date!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I’ve been around for a long time, I just don’t post too often.&nbsp; Among other things, I got into some of the early rules debates back before a lot of stuff had been clarified.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, I actually meant to do something like this last year but I forgot to until after April Fools was already over.</p>",
